{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 25, "model_name": "mistralai/ministral-14b-instruct-2512", "content": "Hark hark good traveler to the fair isle of Japan\nPray lend thine ear to this our merry plan\n\nOn the morn of thine arrival in Nihon’s embrace\nMake haste to Tokyo where wonders shall chase\nThe Shinkansen swift as Cupid’s arrow flies\nBeneath cherry blossoms ‘neath Tokyo’s bright skies\n\nOn the first day mark let thy spirit take flight\nTo Asakusa’s temples bathed in golden light\nThe Sensoji’s bell shall ring clear as a lark\nAnd the Nakamise’s stalls shall with treasures spark\nDine on tempura crisp as autumn’s leaf’s fall\nThen wander Ginza where shoppers all enthrall\n\nUpon the morrow rise with heart anew\nTo Akihabara’s neon dreams come true\nAnime and otaku’s delights shall thee ensnare\nYet mind thy coin for trinkets there are fair\nAt eve let thy feet lead thee to Shinjuku’s glow\nWhere robots and maids in bars of strange show\n\nThe third day lo thy journey to Nikko’s grace\nKegon Falls shall thee in beauty daze\nToshogu’s shrine with gold and art so fine\nDoth stand as testament to samurai’s time\nReturn as the sun doth with mercy descend\nTo Tokyo’s arms where thy weary soul may mend\n\nOn the fourth day take ship to Kyoto’s old ways\nWhere temples and shrines in quiet majesty blaze\nThe Kinkaku-ji’s pond with sunlight doth gleam\nWhile Fushimi Inari’s torii gates do seem\nTo touch the heavens with their crimson hue\nAt dusk Gion’s geisha with secrets move through\n\nThe fifth let thy steps to Nara’s ancient grounds\nWhere deer in the park with gentle manners abound\nTodai-ji’s Buddha doth with wisdom gaze\nWhile Kasuga’s lanterns in twilight’s soft haze\nShall whisper tales of empires long since past\nThen feast on kaki-no-ha sushi thee at last\n\nOn the sixth day let nature’s hand thee guide\nTo Osaka’s castle where history doth reside\nThe Dotonbori’s neon lights shall make thee grin\nWith takoyaki balls ‘neath the moon’s chin\nYet haste thee away ere night’s feast turn to glut\nFor Hiroshima’s call doth echo through thy gut\n\nThe seventh day let thy heart with solemn grace\nBend to the Peace Memorial in quiet embrace\nThe atomic dome still stands with sorrow’s might\nYet Miyajima’s torii in the sea doth delight\nWith floating gates and shrines of olden lore\nAs the setting sun doth paint the bay once more\n\nNow if thy time and spirit still do allow\nLet thy path to Kyoto’s Arashiyama flow\nWhere bamboo groves in emerald whispers bend\nAnd the Tenryu-ji’s tea doth to soul descend\nAt eve let a ryokan’s onsen thee restore\nWith kaiseki’s feast and stars forevermore\n\nUpon the last morn say thy farewells with sigh\nTo Kyoto’s streets where time doth move slowly by\nReturn to Tokyo swift as Mercury’s flight\nWhere Harajuku’s quirky charms shall thee enthrall one last night\n\nWith souvenirs bought and memories made so true\nStand at Narita where thy journey doth end\nYet know that fair Japan in thine heart shall remain\nA land of the rising sun with wonders sans end", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.16029712557792664}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -0.003225721186026931}, {"token": " h", "logprob": -1.5492585897445679}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -0.0038220465648919344}, {"token": " good", "logprob": -0.4081418216228485}, {"token": " travel", "logprob": -0.351406067609787}, {"token": "er", "logprob": -0.0007333449902944267}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -2.4611754417419434}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -1.5284624099731445}, {"token": " fair", "logprob": -1.4602327346801758}, {"token": " is", "logprob": -0.8512212038040161}, {"token": "le", "logprob": -0.1798904538154602}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -0.0738174095749855}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -0.5912235379219055}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.6644269824028015}, {"token": "P", "logprob": -5.6762213706970215}, {"token": "ray", "logprob": -0.13947878777980804}, {"token": " lend", "logprob": -0.4247856140136719}, {"to